Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:45:27 +0800
Subject: drm/histb: vdp4: drive the planes through the shared glue

The v4 engine repeats the component and plane glue the v2 engine holds.
Move it onto the shared engine module the common code now provides.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 65 insertions(+), 270 deletions(-)


diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/histb/histb-vdp4.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/histb/histb-vdp4.c
